Children are a vibrant and valued part of Resurrection, currently making up nearly a third of our congregation.

We offer nursery care and Children’s Church with age-appropriate lessons and activities for preschool through 5th grade. These take place during the Scripture reading and sermon. During the rest of the service—especially at the Lord’s Table—children remain with the congregation, learning the rhythms of worship alongside their families.

We believe this balance helps nurture their spiritual formation while also giving parents the opportunity to fully engage in worship.
